    <briefdescription>
<para>RocksDB-backed provenance store implementation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides persistent storage of provenance records with crash recovery, efficient range scans, and configurable retention policies.</para>
<para>Key schema: &quot;provenance:&lt;query_id&gt;:&lt;step_number:08d&gt;&quot; Time index: &quot;provenance_ts:&lt;timestamp_ms:016x&gt;:&lt;query_id&gt;&quot; </para>
    </detaileddescription>
